# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-miner08-0 = 
    穿过金门，但见一小队矮人，武器蓄势待发。未及反应，身后狂呼的地精蜂拥而至，将矮人卷入一片呼啸砍杀的混乱之中。矮人顽强抵抗。断肢飞舞，鲜血喷涌。濒死地精尖鸣刺破喧嚣。终告平息。幸存矮人溃逃，地精则聚汝身旁。
msg-miner08-1 = 
    The smallest kobold leers up at you. It chirrups, <br><p>    There is no turning back for you<br>          for now the dwarfs will not forget<br>     You. Since you opened up their door<br>          and let us through, their blood to let.<br>     The die is cast, you're on our side,<br>          you must now hope for us to win.<br>     So penetrate much deeper now<br>          Into the caverns, dank with sin.<br>     So go! Seek out the dire place<br>          Where $NamedOneName doth his court now keep.<br>     And fight him there within his lair<br>          Seek victory! March forward! Leap!
msg-miner08-2 = 
    地精之诗未能打动你。然其所言属实。无论成败，唯有寄望地精获胜。汝等最佳之举，便是寻觅并击败矮人之主$NamedOneName。<br><p>
    你请地精相助，然其摇头示意，曰：<br><p>    We only raid and ambush dwarfs<br>          and dare not go too deep within<br>     The dwarfish caves because we can-<br>          not, fighting $NamedOneName, hope to win.<br><p>
    故此事须汝亲力为之。地精迅即夺走阵亡矮人的财物，遁入暗影而去。
msg-miner08-3 = 
    穿过金门，但见一小队矮人，武器蓄势待发。彼等咆哮着发起冲锋。汝回首望，冀求地精相助，然无果。
msg-miner08-4 = 
    穿过金门，但见一小队矮人，武器蓄势待发。汝向其首领致意，彼却低吼回应，<br><p>         Centuries, woebegone,<br>          Once I did trust you, but<br>          Such an act clearly was<br>          foolish and vain.<br>          Prevarication<br>          Was all that you gave to me<br>          Now we must kill you all,<br>          Bring you vast pain.<br><p>
    不妙。闯入矮人领地，触怒彼等。矮人咆哮扑来，汝须奋战。
msg-miner08-5 = 
    一扇熠熠生辉的金门迎面而来。工艺精湛，框架与墙壁浑然一体，严丝合缝。显然，这是矮人的国度之门。门面上，金属上镌刻着以八种语言书写的铭文：<br><p>          Dwarfhome, pass not but dwarfs.<br><p>
    显然，你将不被欢迎入内。你决定……<br><p><opt>...<indent>忽略警告，打开门并进入。<br><p><opt>...<indent>听从警告，关门勿入。
